---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Changelog — ArmorClaw" description="What's new in ArmorClaw.">
  <section class="px-6 py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-bold text-white">Changelog</h1>
      <p class="mb-12 text-[#8b8b92]">
        All notable changes to ArmorClaw. For the full technical changelog, see the
        <a href="https://github.com/Shuriken-Labs-LLC/ArmorClaw" class="text-[#d97706] hover:underline">GitHub repository</a>.
      </p>

      <article class="border-l-2 border-[#d97706] pl-6">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">v1.0 &mdash; Initial release</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#8b8b92]">Coming soon</p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-[#8b8b92]">
            <li>Workspace and project management with persistent context</li>
            <li>Chat with Emerson, your AI agent</li>
            <li>Persistent memory with FTS search, entity/topic classification</li>
            <li>Brain panel with progressive disclosure (4 layers)</li>
            <li>Per-topic dossier generation with pin support</li>
            <li>Scheduled commitments with missed-run policies</li>
            <li>In-app notifications with per-event preferences</li>
            <li>Full audit log</li>
            <li>Workspace markdown export</li>
            <li>Gmail and Google Calendar integration</li>
            <li>9-step onboarding flow</li>
            <li>macOS native: Keychain secrets, tray icon, launch at login</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
